# MAGIC <div class="dbx">
# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">05</span><span class="sec-icon">🔀</span><h2>Controlling the flow</h2></div><p><strong>Run if dependencies:</strong> when should a task with upstream tasks start?</p>
# MAGIC <div class="tbl"><table>
# MAGIC <thead>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <th>Run if</th>
# MAGIC <th>Runs when</th>
# MAGIC <th>Typical use</th>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </thead>
# MAGIC <tbody>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>All succeeded</strong> (default)</td>
# MAGIC <td>every upstream task succeeded</td>
# MAGIC <td>Normal flow</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>At least one succeeded</td>
# MAGIC <td>≥ 1 succeeded</td>
# MAGIC <td>Partial-source processing</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>None failed</td>
# MAGIC <td>nothing failed</td>
# MAGIC <td>Skip-tolerant flows</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td><strong>All done</strong></td>
# MAGIC <td>everything finished, whatever the result</td>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Cleanup</strong>, final notification</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC <tr>
# MAGIC <td>At least one failed / All failed</td>
# MAGIC <td>something (everything) failed</td>
# MAGIC <td><strong>Alerting</strong>, fallback</td>
# MAGIC </tr>
# MAGIC </tbody>
# MAGIC </table></div>
# MAGIC <p><strong>If/else condition task:</strong> branch on a value, e.g. <code>{{tasks.Clean_Data.values.bad_records}} &gt; 0</code>. The <em>true</em> branch fixes the bad records, and the <em>false</em> branch goes straight to aggregation.</p>
# MAGIC <p><strong>For each task:</strong> run a nested task once per item of a list (e.g. per country), with a <strong>concurrency</strong> setting.</p>
# MAGIC </div>

